sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as AI Gateway<br/>Envoy Proxy
    participant ExtProc as ext-proc Server<br/>9004/TCP gRPC
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant NeMo as NeMo Guardrails<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant LLM as External LLM Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,LLM: Flow 1: Inference Request Processing

    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS, Bearer/API key auth
    Envoy->>ExtProc: gRPC ExtProc callout<br/>Request headers + body<br/>Optional TLS, no app-level auth

    Note over ExtProc: Plugin Pipeline Executes

    ExtProc->>ExtProc: maas-headers-guard<br/>Validate required headers
    ExtProc->>ExtProc: body-field-to-header<br/>Extract model from body
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Read ExternalModel/ExternalProvider CRDs<br/>TLS 1.2+, ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>ExtProc: Model-to-provider mapping
    ExtProc->>ExtProc: model-provider-resolver<br/>Resolve provider, set x-ipp-selected-provider

    opt Hub Mode
        ExtProc->>ExtProc: Check X-Origin-Cluster<br/>vs CLUSTER_NAME (loop detection)
        ExtProc->>ExtProc: PROPOSE: advertise spoke endpoints<br/>TRANSFORM: rewrite for final provider
    end

    ExtProc->>ExtProc: stream-usage-enforcer<br/>Ensure usage data in streams
    ExtProc->>ExtProc: api-translation<br/>OpenAI ↔ Anthropic format conversion

    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Read Secret (provider credentials)<br/>TLS 1.2+, ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>ExtProc: API key / SigV4 / OAuth2 credentials
    ExtProc->>ExtProc: apikey-injection<br/>Inject Authorization header

    opt NeMo Guardrails Enabled
        ExtProc->>NeMo: POST /guardrails/check<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, no auth
        NeMo-->>ExtProc: Allow / Block decision
    end

    ExtProc-->>Envoy: ProcessingResponse<br/>+ DynamicMetadata (via wrapper)
    Envoy->>LLM: Forward request to provider<br/>HTTPS 443, TLS via DestinationRule<br/>API key / SigV4 / OAuth2
    LLM-->>Envoy: Inference response
    Envoy-->>Client: JSON/SSE response

    Note over Client,LLM: Flow 2: ExternalModel Reconciliation

    Note over ExtProc,K8sAPI: ExternalModel Controller
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Watch ExternalModel CRs<br/>TLS 1.2+, ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>ExtProc: ExternalModel event
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Get ExternalProvider<br/>TLS 1.2+, ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>ExtProc: ExternalProvider spec
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HTTPRoute<br/>with x-ipp-selected-provider match rules
    K8sAPI-->>ExtProc: HTTPRoute created

    Note over Client,LLM: Flow 3: ExternalProvider Reconciliation

    Note over ExtProc,K8sAPI: ExternalProvider Controller
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Watch ExternalProvider CRs<br/>TLS 1.2+, ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>ExtProc: ExternalProvider event
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Validate Secret exists<br/>+ ValidateConnectionSecurity
    K8sAPI-->>ExtProc: Secret validated
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Service +<br/>ServiceEntry + DestinationRule
    K8sAPI-->>ExtProc: Networking resources created
